This package is an unofficial, community-maintained build of PicoGK for
WebAssembly. It is not affiliated with, endorsed by, or supported by LEAP 71.
It is produced for local consumption inside one build and is not published to
any package feed.

This product includes material derived from the following LEAP 71 projects,
each licensed under the Apache License, Version 2.0
(http://www.apache.org/licenses/LICENSE-2.0):

