  Copyright (c) 2023-2026 LEAP 71, https://leap71.com
  https://github.com/leap71/PicoGK
  The managed library under base/source/ is this C# library at the commit the
  manifest records, unchanged except for the patches base/patches/ carries.
  Its own license text is base/source/LICENSE.

  PicoGKRuntime, compiled to WebAssembly with modifications
  Copyright (c) 2023-2026 LEAP 71
  https://github.com/leap71/PicoGKRuntime
  The engine archives under engine/ are built from it. The modifications are
